---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Learn how Abdurakhmon Dadaboev moved from art and electronic engineering into practical AI vision research."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>From physical systems to intelligent ones.</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="about-intro">
      <p>I was born in Uzbekistan and came to South Korea in 2017 to learn Korean. Since then, my path has moved through fine art, automatic systems, electronic engineering, and Big Data Science.</p>
      <p>That mixed background shapes how I approach AI: I care about the complete system, not only the model. Good technology must fit its data, environment, users, and operational limits.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="profile-grid">
    <div class="profile-photo">
      <Image
        src="/images/profile-2026.jpeg"
        width={1110}
        height={1250}
        alt="Portrait of Abdurakhmon Dadaboev"
        class="photo"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="profile-card card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Now</p>
      <h2>AI vision researcher in Sejong.</h2>
      <p>I am completing an M.S. in Big Data Science at Korea University with a 4.46/4.5 GPA. My recent work connects data curation, computer vision, similarity search, and offline inference for problems where reliability matters.</p>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>Sejong, South Korea</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Computer vision · Data systems · Applied ML</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Languages</dt><dd>Uzbek · Korean · English · Russian</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Outside work</dt><dd>Reading · Sketching · Cross-cultural exchange</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="focus-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Current focus</p>
        <h2>Three connected layers.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>I work across the full path from raw data to a system that a person can actually use.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="focus-card card"><span>01</span><h3>Data curation</h3><p>Define collection rules, remove duplicates, organize metadata, and create review workflows before model training.</p></div>
      <div class="focus-card card"><span>02</span><h3>Vision modeling</h3><p>Build segmentation, classification, retrieval, and knowledge-distillation pipelines with practical evaluation.</p></div>
      <div class="focus-card card"><span>03</span><h3>System delivery</h3><p>Design for offline operation, limited memory, API constraints, consistent outputs, and clear human decisions.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="experience-section">
    <div class="experience-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Recent path</p>
      <h2>Learning by building.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-meta">2026.07 — Present</div>
        <div class="timeline-title">North American Road Data & Auto-Labeling</div>
        <div class="timeline-subtitle">Hyundai Motor Genesis Chassis Test Team · Vegas · Korea University</div>
        <div class="timeline-content"><p>Designing a Mapillary-based collection pipeline with DINOv3 embeddings, FAISS similarity search, and a manual review tool for road-image curation.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-meta">2026.07</div>
        <div class="timeline-title">AI Vision Research Intern</div>
        <div class="timeline-subtitle">Youngchang Labs</div>
        <div class="timeline-content"><p>Worked on road-image dataset construction and analysis, vision-model development, and North American road-data collection.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-meta">2026.02 — Present</div>
        <div class="timeline-title">Offline Exam OCR System</div>
        <div class="timeline-subtitle">Big Data Mining Lab · Korea University</div>
        <div class="timeline-content"><p>Designed the system architecture and core functions for PDF alignment, OMR matching, answer extraction, OCR, and result storage.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-meta">2025.03 — 2025.12</div>
        <div class="timeline-title">Road Damage Detection Research</div>
        <div class="timeline-subtitle">Crowdsourcing-based Mobility Support · Project R2320973</div>
        <div class="timeline-content"><p>Led the AI vision work for road cracks, potholes, and severity classification. Redesigned the annotation approach and obtained an official model test report.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-meta">2024.03 — 2026.08 (Expected)</div>
        <div class="timeline-title">M.S. in Big Data Science</div>
        <div class="timeline-subtitle">Korea University, Sejong Campus</div>
        <div class="timeline-content"><p>Research in computer vision, data mining, deep learning, and text mining. Graduate teaching assistant from September 2024 to December 2025.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-meta">2019.03 — 2023.02</div>
        <div class="timeline-title">B.S. in Electronic Engineering</div>
        <div class="timeline-subtitle">Sun Moon University</div>
        <div class="timeline-content"><p>Built foundations in circuits, embedded systems, control, and hardware-software integration. Graduated with a 4.18/4.5 GPA.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="toolkit-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Toolkit</p>
    <div class="toolkit-grid">
      <h2>Tools I use to move from experiment to system.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Python</li><li>PyTorch</li><li>OpenCV</li><li>Ultralytics YOLO</li><li>DINOv3</li><li>FAISS</li><li>Mapillary API</li><li>SQLite</li><li>Git</li><li>Jupyter</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .about-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(18rem, 0.9fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); align-items: end; padding-block: 1.5rem clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
    .about-hero h1 { max-width: 11ch; }
    .about-intro p { font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 2vw, 1.16rem); line-height: 1.78; }
    .about-intro p + p { margin-top: 1rem; }
    .profile-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(18rem, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); }
    .profile-photo { overflow: hidden; min-height: 35rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-soft); }
    .photo { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 20%; }
    .profile-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
    .profile-card h2 { max-width: 11ch; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .profile-card > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 38rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1rem; }
    dl { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    dl div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr; gap: 1rem; padding-block: 0.8rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 0.82rem; }
    dt { color: var(--ink-muted); }
    dd { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
    .focus-section { margin-bottom: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); }
    .focus-card { box-shadow: none; }
    .focus-card > span { color: var(--accent); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; }
    .focus-card h3 { margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem; }
    .focus-card p { font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .experience-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(14rem, 0.65fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr); gap: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 8rem); margin-bottom: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); }
    .experience-heading { position: sticky; top: 7rem; align-self: start; }
    .experience-heading h2 { max-width: 7ch; }
    .timeline { margin-top: 0; }
    .toolkit-section { padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-soft); }
    .toolkit-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
    .toolkit-grid h2 { max-width: 13ch; }
    .toolkit-grid ul { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-content: start; gap: 0.55rem; list-style: none; }
    .toolkit-grid li { padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; color: var(--ink-soft); background: var(--surface); font-size: 0.78rem; }
    @media (max-width: 820px) { .about-hero, .profile-grid, .experience-section, .toolkit-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .profile-photo { min-height: 28rem; } .experience-heading { position: static; } .experience-heading h2 { max-width: none; } }
    @media (max-width: 520px) { dl div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.2rem; } }
  </style>
</Layout>
